WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.433
Hi! I'm Sofia. This is my routine.

2
00:00:04.883 --> 00:00:07.669
I wake up at six thirty. Good morning!

3
00:00:09.919 --> 00:00:13.216
First, I take a shower. Then I get dressed.

4
00:00:15.466 --> 00:00:18.903
After that, I have breakfast at seven. I love coffee!

5
00:00:21.153 --> 00:00:23.893
I start work at eight. I have lunch at noon.

6
00:00:26.143 --> 00:00:31.855
After work, I go to the gym. Finally, I go to bed at eleven. Good night!

